OL,3,GNEWSAFourteen people linked to
OL,4,Aevidential activity at time of Omagh
OL,5,Abomb, inquiry told
OL,6,
OL,7,FFourteen people have been linked to
OL,8,Fevidential activity in the days leading
OL,9,Fup to and on the day of the Omagh
OL,10,Fbombing, the inquiry into the explosion
OL,11,Fhas heard.
OL,13,FPaul Greaney KC outlined the "working
OL,14,Fhypothesis" of the inquiry when it
OL,15,Fresumed its latest phase on Monday.
OL,17,FIn a statement to the inquiry, sitting
OL,18,Fat Bradford Court in Belfast, he named
OL,19,FSeamus McKenna, Seamus Daly and Colm
OL,20,FMurphy as among the 14.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
