OL,5,Abomb, inquiry told
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,8,Fpregnant with twins, died in the
OL,9,Fbombing in the County Tyrone town on 15
OL,10,FAugust 1998 - the biggest single
OL,11,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
